' ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
' ║  DIAGRAMA DINAMICO — FLUXO: SIMULACAO + SATELITE                   ║
' ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
@startuml C4_Dinamico_Fluxo
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam backgroundColor #0d1a0d
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #1a2a1a
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #3a6a3a
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #e8f5e8
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #4ade80
skinparam sequenceArrowFontColor #86efac
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2a5a2a
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #0f1a0f
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #2a5a2a
skinparam sequenceGroupFontColor #86efac
skinparam noteBorderColor #2a5a2a
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #0f1a0f
skinparam noteFontColor #86efac
skinparam defaultFontColor #d4f0d4

title "DS Embrapa MA — Fluxo Dinamico: Simulacao de Plantio e Projecao Satelite"

actor "Pesquisador\nEmbrapa" as USR
participant "Interface\n(index.html)" as UI
participant "simulador.js\n_saState" as SIM
participant "layouts.js\nSA_LAYOUTS" as LAY
participant "metricas.js" as MET
participant "visualizacao.js" as VIZ
participant "dados_agricolas.js\nSA_SYSTEMS" as DAD
participant "Esri Tiles\n(Leaflet)" as ESRI

== 1. Configuracao inicial do simulador ==
USR -> UI  : Seleciona sistema, variante e layout
UI  -> SIM : sa_runSimulation()
SIM -> DAD : SA_SYSTEMS[system]
DAD --> SIM : SistemaProdutivo + Variante
SIM -> LAY : generate(areaM2, sRow, sPlant, angle, nSp)
LAY --> SIM : PlantPosition[] {x, y, speciesIdx}
SIM -> MET : sa_calcMetricas(state, positions)
MET --> SIM : Metrics {shannonH, renda, carbono...}
SIM -> VIZ : sa_drawPlantacao(canvas, state, positions)
VIZ --> UI  : canvas renderizado HiDPI
SIM -> UI   : sa_renderMetrics() + sa_renderAlertas()

== 2. Slider alterado — resposta imediata ==
USR -> UI  : Move slider (Area / Espacamento / Angulo)
UI  -> SIM : sa_onSlider()
activate SIM
SIM -> SIM : Atualiza _saState (sincrono)
SIM -> MET : sa_calcMetricas(state, _saPositions)
MET --> SIM : Metrics {}
SIM -> UI   : sa_renderMetrics() IMEDIATO
note right of UI : Cards atualizam sem\nespetar re-geracao\ndas posicoes
SIM -> SIM : setTimeout(sa_runSimulation, 280ms)
deactivate SIM

... 280ms (debounce) ...

SIM -> LAY : generate() com novos parametros
LAY --> SIM : PlantPosition[] atualizado
SIM -> MET : sa_calcMetricas() final
SIM -> VIZ : sa_drawPlantacao() re-renderiza

== 3. Ativa sub-aba Satelite ==
USR -> UI  : Clica "Projecao Satelite"
UI  -> SIM : sa_switchView('sat') -> sa_satInit()
SIM -> ESRI : Leaflet TileLayer (World Imagery)
ESRI --> SIM : tiles PNG via HTTPS
SIM -> UI   : sa_satDrawPlants(autoFit=true)\nL.circleMarker por planta\nfitBounds -> enquadra plantio

== 4. Pesquisa de municipio ==
USR -> UI  : Digita municipio no datalist
UI  -> SIM : sa_satSelectByName(name)
SIM -> SIM : _saSatCenter = {lat, lng}\n_saSatMap.setView([lat,lng], 14)
SIM -> UI   : sa_satDrawPlants(autoFit=true)\nfitBounds -> nova localizacao

== 5. Redimensionar area arrastando canto ==
USR -> UI  : Arrasta alca de canto (L.marker)
UI  -> SIM : cm.on('drag', e)
activate SIM
SIM -> SIM : dist = sqrt(dx2+dy2)\nhalf = dist / sqrt(2)\nnewArea = (2*dist2)/10000 ha
SIM -> UI   : Atualiza slider + label area
SIM -> SIM : _saSatBoundary.setLatLngs()\ncorners movidos simetricamente
SIM -> MET : sa_calcMetricas(state, _saPositions)
SIM -> UI   : sa_renderMetrics() AO VIVO
deactivate SIM

USR -> UI  : Solta alca (dragend)
UI  -> SIM : setTimeout(sa_runSimulation, 100ms)
note right of SIM : Regenera posicoes\ncom nova area.\nZoom preservado\n(sem autoFit)
@enduml
